/*
  Deep Sea theme - glowing jellyfish over a coral reef, with a little yellow
  submarine shining its lights (res/images/deepsea.jpg, light rays softened).
  Jellyfish cyan frames, coral for money coming in, submarine yellow totals,
  and darker panels.

  The layout is res/flapxcoin.qss, below its variables; the base colours come
  from the theme table in guiutil.cpp.
*/

